Problem:3793. Find Users with High Token Usage
Difficulty: Easy, AI Prompt based mysql question

Solution:

MySql

SELECT 
    user_id,
    COUNT(*) As prompt_count,
    ROUND(AVG(tokens), 2) AS avg_tokens
FROM 
    prompts
GROUP BY 
    user_id
HAVING 
    COUNT(*) >= 3
    AND MAX(tokens) > AVG(tokens)
ORDER BY 
    AVG(tokens) DESC,
